      "value": "<p><strong>Heritage Signature (RFI v1.0).</strong></p><p><em>&ldquo;Motion is sight. Sight is motion.&rdquo;</em></p><p><strong>The Wheel Never Stops.</strong> When you move at least 10 ft on your turn, you may 1/Soma Break use a bonus action to either <strong>Dash</strong> or make <strong>one weapon strike</strong>. You do not provoke opportunity strikes from creatures whose line-of-sight to you was broken during the movement.</p>",
